  m_text: 'Dayakattam (Thayam) is an ancient tactical board game played across Tamil
    Nadu for millennia during auspicious festive gatherings.


    Four players sit
    at the corners of a sacred 7x7 board. Your goal is to guide all 3 Kalasam spirit
    pawns clockwise around the outer loop, spiral through the inner rings, and ascend
    into the Central Sacred Palace.'
